</div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, canonical names <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check\\kappa\">\\(\\check\\kappa\\)</span>, and the six-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the exact source symbols.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PreservesCofinality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PreservesCofinality}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PreservesCofinality}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner\\mathrm{cf}(v_0)=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\check\\kappa,\\check{\\mathrm{cf}^{V}(\\kappa)}\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}preserves\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5PreservesCofinality}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner\\mathrm{cf}(v_0)=v_1\\urcorner,\\langle\\check\\kappa,\\chec